ays shows up:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db5c4a5a-ce54-4924-b0c9-891ae643dfb3)\n\nAnd I have to cancel as many times as there are shaders open. I dont understand why this happens, I didn't save or modify any shader.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new ShaderInclude in the inspector, \n- Unfocus Godot (tab out, or click on another window)\n- Focus Godot back by clicking on it or tab back to it\n- Observe dialog showing up\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN.A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106239/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}